%% Sponsored transaction flow
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Dialog as Porto Dialog
    participant Merchant as Merchant Worker
    participant Relay as Porto Relay
    participant Funder as SimpleFunder
    participant Account as Ithaca Account
    participant Chain as Gwyneth L1

    User->>Dialog: sendCalls(calls, merchantUrl)
    Dialog-->>Merchant: wallet_prepareCalls
    Merchant-->>Relay: Forward request (feePayer = merchant)
    Relay-->>Merchant: Quote + digest
    Merchant-->>Merchant: Sign feeSignature
    Merchant-->>Dialog: feeSignature + context
    Dialog->>User: Prompt for WebAuthn signature
    User-->>Dialog: Sign digest (AA key)
    Dialog-->>Relay: wallet_sendPreparedCalls
    Relay-->>Funder: fund() (pull ETH)
    Funder-->>Account: Transfer ETH for gas
    Relay-->>Chain: Execute bundle (gas reimbursed)
    Chain-->>Relay: Bundle success
    Relay-->>Dialog: callsStatus = success
    Dialog-->>User: Success + balance update
